translate ptPT strings:

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/qst_TheTerminus.rpy:4
    old "Get gold from the chest"
    new "Pegar ouro do baú"

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/qst_TheTerminus.rpy:4
    old "I will certainly need some currency to handle whatever today brings. There must be some in my chest."
    new "Certamente precisarei de algum dinheiro para lidar com o que quer que hoje traga. Deve haver algum no meu baú."

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/qst_TheTerminus.rpy:4
    old "Head out of your room"
    new "Saia do seu quarto"

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/qst_TheTerminus.rpy:4
    old "It's time to head out."
    new "É hora de sair."

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/qst_TheTerminus.rpy:4
    old "Attend the Terminus Ceremony"
    new "Comparecer à Cerimônia do Términus"

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/qst_TheTerminus.rpy:4
    old "The Terminus Ceremony is held in the Royal Palace, at the very heart of the City of Novaras. I should make haste."
    new "A Cerimônia do Términus é realizada no Palácio Real, no coração da Cidade de Novaras. Devo me apressar."

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/qst_TheTerminus.rpy:4
    old "Meet Adara at the tavern\nor visit the bordello"
    new "Encontrar Adara na taverna\nou visitar o bordel"

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/qst_TheTerminus.rpy:4
    old "Struck by the prospect of joining the Scouts Corp, I am unsure how to spend the remainder of today. Markus went for the pleasure district to get laid. I remember Adara talking about catching up at the Iron Unicorn tavern, after the ceremony."
    new "Impressionado com a perspectiva de entrar para o Corpo de Batedores, não sei ao certo como passar o resto do dia de hoje. Markus foi ao distrito do prazer para transar. Lembro-me de Adara falar em se encontrar na taverna Unicórnio de Ferro, após a cerimônia."

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/qst_TheTerminus.rpy:4
    old "Return home"
    new "Voltar para casa"

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/qst_TheTerminus.rpy:4
    old "There goes my last night in the city as a free citizen. I should head home and try to get some sleep."
    new "Lá se vai minha última noite na cidade como cidadão livre. Devo ir para casa e tentar dormir um pouco."

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/qst_TheTerminus.rpy:4
    old "Report to Fort Sebastian"
    new "Apresentar-se no Forte Sebastian"

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/qst_TheTerminus.rpy:4
    old "During the Terminus Ceremony held yesterday I have found out that I am to be a part of the Scouts Corp, the reconnaissance branch of Emperor Alcott's army. I am to report to Fort Sebastian to begin my training. Some graduation..."
    new "Durante a Cerimônia do Términus realizada ontem, descobri que farei parte do Corpo de Batedores, o ramo de reconhecimento do exército do Imperador Alcott. Devo me apresentar no Forte Sebastian para iniciar meu treinamento. Que formatura..."

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/qst_TheTerminus.rpy:24
    old "The Terminus"
    new "O Terminus"

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/qst_TheTerminus.rpy:25
    old "As I have come of age, the Terminus Ceremony is about to decide my future for life. I will find out what fate has our kingdom blessed me with. Hopefully, I am prepared for it."
    new "Ao atingir a maioridade, a Cerimônia do Terminus está prestes a decidir meu futuro para toda a vida. Descobrirei com o que o destino e nosso reino me abençoaram. Espero estar preparado para isso."

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/qst_TheTerminus.rpy:64
    old "I should grab my gold first."
    new "Devo pegar meu ouro primeiro."

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/qst_TheTerminus.rpy:380
    old "Loyal Citizen!"
    new "Cidadão Leal!"

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/qst_TheTerminus.rpy:384
